GLM-5.3-Flash (glm5next) CPU library, step 2 of 5: eight-channel inner loop for the fused pool kernel.
Deployed 2026-09-19. Byte-identical. GGML_CPU_GLM_POOL_WIDE=1, default off. Apply after glm5next-kpool-fusion-statecopy.patch.
Result: CPU library sha256 3f957a341321b940d93be53c250cdd068825093faa2d9efda142ebe56427b1b3 (current production).

Groups eight channels, hoists the four member-cell lookups out of the channel loop, and keeps scalar expf, float products,
sequential double accumulation and the double reciprocal, so every output byte matches the scalar kernel.

